# Experiment harness — per-run artifacts (timestamped dirs created by
# `scripts/experiment.py run`) are ephemeral. The two exceptions stay in git:
#   - experiments/golden/   — fixtures pinned by tests/test_experiment_metrics.py
#   - experiments/manifests/ — declarative specs are the source of truth
